# Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Secrets — never send to the build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem

# Not needed to build
.git
.github
.husky
.claude
.agents
**/logs
**/tests
apps/api/docs
**/postman
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
